# Architecture

Top-level
- app/: Nuxt 4 application
- microservice/: companion microservice (Nitro/H3 based server.ts)
- .deploy/: Kubernetes templates and profiles
- .github/: CI workflows and composite actions
- scripts/: local and CI helpers (DB restore, coverage, key rotation tooling, governance checks)

App (Nuxt) structure
- UI
  - app/pages/: route-aligned Vue SFCs (login, account-registers, reoccurrences, reconciliation, reports, admin, etc.). `index.vue` is the marketing homepage; logged-in visits are redirected by `middleware/guest.ts` to the post-login app path
  - app/middleware/: client route guards (`auth`, `admin`, `guest`)
  - app/components/: shared UI and complex modals (EditRegisterEntry, EditReoccurrence, BudgetManager, etc.)
  - app/layouts/, app/app.vue: layouts and app shell
  - app/assets/css/main.css: Tailwind/utilities
  - app/plugins/disable-lastpass.client.ts: block LastPass on all forms except login/signup (`data-lp-allow`)
- State & composables
  - app/stores/: Pinia stores (authStore, listStore)
  - app/composables/: useAPI, useSnapshotMode, useCategoryReports, etc.
- Server (Nitro/H3)
  - app/server/api/: REST-like endpoints by path and method suffix (.get.ts, .post.ts, etc.)
  - app/server/lib/: server utilities (auth/mfa helpers, error handling, pagination, rate limit, queue manager, etc.)
  - app/server/services/: domain services (Plaid, transaction matching, notifications, reconciliation / statement extract+match, forecast/* modules)
  - Statement reconciliation: `.agent/logic/reconciliation.mdc`
  - app/server/clients/: prisma, redis, nats, postmark, openai
  - app/server/queues/: BullMQ queue definitions (backupQueue, plaidSync*, recalculateQueue)
  - app/server/cron/: nuxt-cron periodic jobs (plaid.daily, plaid-balance.hourly, recalculate.hourly, etc.)
  - Plaid domain notes: `.agent/logic/plaid.mdc`
  - app/server/middleware/: H3 middlewares (auth, sitemap-redirect)
  - app/server/plugins/: server lifecycle helpers (graceful, security-headers, initTestDate)
  - app/server/routes/: health/live.get.ts, health/ready.get.ts, sitemap, and _nuxt passthrough
- Configuration and schema
  - app/nuxt.config.ts, app/app.config.ts
  - app/server/env.ts, app/server/envSchema.ts (Zod-validated configuration)
  - app/prisma/schema.prisma, app/prisma/migrations/*, app/prisma/seed.ts
  - app/prisma/reencrypt/*: generated re-encryption helpers from prisma-field-encryption
  - app/prisma/prismaClient.ts: Prisma client bootstrap for app
- Tests
  - app/server/api/__tests__/: endpoint coverage
  - app/server/services/**/__tests__/: service and forecast engine tests
  - app/lib/__tests__/, app/schema/__tests__/, app/pages/__tests__/: unit/integration
  - app/tests/e2e/: Playwright specs and setup; visual snapshots
  - Vitest configs: app/vitest.*

Microservice
- microservice/server.ts: entrypoint (Nitro/H3 via listhen/nitropack)
- microservice/routes/: migrate.get.ts, migrate.post.ts, test.get.ts
- microservice/prisma/: separate Prisma schema subset and migrations; reencrypt/* generated
- microservice/clients/: prisma and redis clients
- microservice/lib/bull.ts: BullMQ utilities
- Dockerfile: build with a special runner-keyrotate target used for staging key rotation CronJob

Data model highlights (app/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Core: User, Account, Budget, AccountRegister, RegisterEntry (+ types), Category (+ tree), Interval
- Recurrence: Reoccurrence, ReoccurrenceSplit, ReoccurrenceSkip, aliasing to Plaid names
- Bills: BillProfile, BillInstance
- Reconciliation: ReconciliationPeriod, ReconciliationItem
- Snapshots: AccountSnapshot, AccountRegisterSnapshot, RegisterEntrySnapshot
- Notifications: NotificationEvent, NotificationDismissal
- Integrations/logging: PlaidItem, PlaidSyncCursor, PlaidSyncLog, IntegrationAlert, IntegrationJobLog, OpenAiRequestLog
- Crypto and cash: EvmChain, CryptoRegisterChain, CryptoTokenBalance, CashOnHand
- Security keys: Rsa

Execution/data flow
- H3 API route → server/lib auth/context → validate (Zod schemas in app/schema) → delegate to server/services/* → persist via server/clients/prismaClient.ts → enqueue jobs as needed (BullMQ) → respond with normalized payloads
- Periodic jobs via app/server/cron/* and queues under app/server/queues/*
- Forecast engine modules under app/server/services/forecast orchestrate data loading, calculations (loans, transfers, reoccurrences), and persistence; tested extensively

Deploy and runtime
- Container images: app/Dockerfile and microservice/Dockerfile (multi-stage)
- Kubernetes manifests templated in .deploy/dineros.template.yaml and key-rotation manifests
- CI builds images to gcr.io and deploys to GKE; health endpoints under /health/live and /health/ready
